        <obo:IAO_0000028>Lamp5-like Pax6 MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Pip5k1b (Mmus), Pax6 (Mmus). These cells also express Pax6 (Mmus). The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Pax6 (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Pip5k1b (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Lamp5 Pax6</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Lamp5-like Pax6</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Lamp5_4</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Pip5k1b (Mmus), Pax6 (Mmus) expressing GABAergic interneuron of primary motor cortex (Mus musculus)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Lamp5-like Pax6 primary motor cortex GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
