        <obo:IAO_0000028>Lamp5 Egln3_2 MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Crim1 (Mmus), Zfp804b (Mmus). These cells also express Lamp5 (Mmus), Egln3 (Mmus). The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Crim1 (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Zfp804b (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Canopy cell</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Crim1 (Mmus), Zfp804b (Mmus) expressing GABAergic interneuron of primary motor cortex (Mus musculus)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Lamp5 Egln3_2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Lamp5 Egln3_2 primary motor cortex GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
