        <obo:IAO_0000028>L6 CT Kit_2 MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Nr4a2 (Mmus), Rxfp1 (Mmus), Tshz2 (Mmus), Gm26883 (Mmus). These cells also express Kit (Mmus). These cells have projection type corticothalamic projecting. The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer VI. The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_80.</obo:IAO_0000115>
