        <obo:IAO_0000028>L5/6 NP_1 MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Dkk2 (Mmus), Cyp7b1 (Mmus), Vwc2l (Mmus). These cells have projection type near projecting. The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer V/VI. The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_86.</obo:IAO_0000115>
