        <obo:IAO_0000028>Meis2_Top2a MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A meis2 expressing cortical GABAergic cell of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Igfbpl1 (Mmus), Gm17750 (Mmus), Gm29260 (Mmus). These cells also express Meis2 (Mmus), Top2a (Mmus). The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_90.</obo:IAO_0000115>
