        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Igfbpl1 (Mmus), Gm17750 (Mmus), Gm29260 (Mmus) expressing meis2 expressing cortical GABAergic cell of primary motor cortex (Mus musculus)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
