        <obo:IAO_0000028>OPC Pdgfra MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A oligodendrocyte precursor cell of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Pdgfra (Mmus), Stk32a (Mmus). These cells also express Pdgfra (Mmus). The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_91.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Pdgfra (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
