        <obo:IAO_0000028>L5 non-Martinotti cell MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Rbp4 (Mmus), Trpc6 (Mmus), Lgals1 (Mmus). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer V. The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_161.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Lgals1 (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Rbp4 (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>Trpc6 (Mmus)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>L5 non-Martinotti cell</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Rbp4 (Mmus), Trpc6 (Mmus), Lgals1 (Mmus) expressing GABAergic interneuron of primary motor cortex (Mus musculus)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>L5 non-Martinotti cell primary motor cortex GABAergic interneuron (Mmus)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
