        <obo:IAO_0000028>IT projecting MOp (Mouse)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Mus musculus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of Fstl4 (Mmus), Satb2 (Mmus). These cells have projection type intratelencephalic projecting. The reference data for this cell type is CS202002013_182.</obo:IAO_0000115>
