        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1 LAMP5 RAB11FIP1 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of FREM1 (Hsap), MYH11 (Hsap), ADAMTS20 (Hsap). These cells also express LAMP5 (Hsap), RAB11FIP1P1 (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer I. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
