        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1-6 LAMP5 NES M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of ROR2 (Hsap), KIT (Hsap), NTNG1 (Hsap), EPHA3 (Hsap), EYA4 (Hsap). These cells also express LAMP5 (Hsap), NES (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
