        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1 PAX6 MIR101-1 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of RELN (Hsap), TGFBR2 (Hsap). These cells also express PAX6 (Hsap), MIR101-1 (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer I. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_8.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>RELN (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>TGFBR2 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
