        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1-3 VIP HSPB6 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of IGFBP5 (Hsap), CCNG2 (Hsap). These cells also express VIP (Hsap), HSPB6 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_21.</obo:IAO_0000115>
