        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L5-6 SST BEAN1 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of TRHDE (Hsap), THSD7B (Hsap), SEMA5A (Hsap), ADAMTSL1 (Hsap). These cells also express SST (Hsap), BEAN1 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_53.</obo:IAO_0000115>
