        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>TRHDE (Hsap), THSD7B (Hsap), SEMA5A (Hsap), ADAMTSL1 (Hsap) expressing GABAergic interneuron of primary motor cortex (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
