        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L6 SST TH M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of LOC100128108 (Hsap), TH (Hsap). These cells also express SST (Hsap), TH (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer VI. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_58.</obo:IAO_0000115>
