        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L5 PVALB LRIG3 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of CDH6 (Hsap), GPC5 (Hsap), PLCE1 (Hsap). These cells also express PVALB (Hsap), LRIG3 (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer V. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_62.</obo:IAO_0000115>
