        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L3-5 RORB LAMA4 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of TRPC3 (Hsap), LOC100128497 (Hsap), LOC101927281 (Hsap), LOC105376081 (Hsap), KCNH8 (Hsap). These cells also express RORB (Hsap), LAMA4 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_84.</obo:IAO_0000115>
