        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L5 THEMIS VILL M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of LOC101927389 (Hsap), DACH1 (Hsap), TNC (Hsap). These cells also express THEMIS (Hsap), VILL (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer V. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_85.</obo:IAO_0000115>
