        <owl:annotatedTarget>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of COL22A1 (Hsap), RMST (Hsap). These cells also express RORB (Hsap), OTOGL (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer III. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_86.</owl:annotatedTarget>
