        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L5 RORB MED8 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of NPFFR2 (Hsap), COL22A1 (Hsap), LOC401134 (Hsap). These cells also express RORB (Hsap), MED8 (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer V. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_92.</obo:IAO_0000115>
