        <obo:IAO_0000028>(Mouse IT projecting)-like(i) M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of CUX2 (Hsap), FAM19A1 (Hsap). These cells have projection type intratelencephalic projecting. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_171.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>CUX2 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>FAM19A1 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>(Mouse IT projecting)-like(i)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CUX2 (Hsap), FAM19A1 (Hsap) expressing glutamatergic neuron of primary motor cortex (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>L2/3 IT</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>(Mouse IT projecting)-like(i) primary motor cortex glutamatergic neuron (Hsap)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
