        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc THEMIS ANO3 M1 (Marmoset)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Callithrix jacchus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of SLIT3 (Cjac), NPFFR2 (Cjac), SLC38A11 (Cjac), CHST9 (Cjac). These cells also express THEMIS (Cjac), ANO3 (Cjac). The reference data for this cell type is CS201912132_53.</obo:IAO_0000115>
