        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc THEMIS KCTD16 M1 (Marmoset)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Callithrix jacchus primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of PTPRK (Cjac), THEMIS (Cjac), CSGALNACT1 (Cjac), PLXDC2 (Cjac). These cells also express THEMIS (Cjac), KCTD16 (Cjac). The reference data for this cell type is CS201912132_59.</obo:IAO_0000115>
