        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1-2 PAX6 TNFAIP8L3 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of LINC01497 (Hsap), SP8 (Hsap). These cells also express PAX6 (Hsap), TNFAIP8L3 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210002.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>LINC01497 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>SP8 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Inh L1-2 PAX6 TNFAIP8L3</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>LINC01497 (Hsap), SP8 (Hsap) expressing GABAergic interneuron of middle temporal gyrus (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Inh L1-2 PAX6 TNFAIP8L3 middle temporal gyrus GABAergic interneuron (Hsap)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
