        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1-4 LAMP5 LCP2 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of KIT (Hsap), CPLX3 (Hsap). These cells also express LAMP5 (Hsap), LCP2 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210004.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>CPLX3 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>KIT (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Inh L1-4 LAMP5 LCP2</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>KIT (Hsap), CPLX3 (Hsap) expressing GABAergic interneuron of middle temporal gyrus (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Rosehip</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Inh L1-4 LAMP5 LCP2 middle temporal gyrus GABAergic interneuron (Hsap)</rdfs:label>
