        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1-2 ADARB2 MC4R MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of ARHGAP36 (Hsap), ADAM33 (Hsap). These cells also express ADARB2 (Hsap), MC4R (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210008.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>ADAM33 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>ARHGAP36 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
