        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L2-5 VIP TYR MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of COL15A1 (Hsap), TAC3 (Hsap). These cells also express VIP (Hsap), TYR (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210019.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>COL15A1 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>TAC3 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>COL15A1 (Hsap), TAC3 (Hsap) expressing GABAergic interneuron of middle temporal gyrus (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Inh L2-5 VIP TYR</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Inh L2-5 VIP TYR middle temporal gyrus GABAergic interneuron (Hsap)</rdfs:label>
