        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L1-4 VIP OPRM1 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of LINC01583 (Hsap), PCP4 (Hsap), SLC22A3 (Hsap). These cells also express VIP (Hsap), OPRM1 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210027.</obo:IAO_0000115>
