        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L4-6 SST B3GAT2 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of NMU (Hsap), FREM1 (Hsap), TAC3 (Hsap). These cells also express SST (Hsap), B3GAT2 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210030.</obo:IAO_0000115>
