        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L5-6 PVALB LGR5 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of ANKRD34B (Hsap), LOC401478 (Hsap), CPED1 (Hsap). These cells also express PVALB (Hsap), LGR5 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210040.</obo:IAO_0000115>
