        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L2-4 PVALB WFDC2 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of SLC9A9 (Hsap), TAC1 (Hsap). These cells also express PVALB (Hsap), WFDC2 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210042.</obo:IAO_0000115>
