        <obo:IAO_0000028>Inh L4-6 PVALB SULF1 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A GABAergic interneuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of SULF1 (Hsap), CPED1 (Hsap). These cells also express PVALB (Hsap), SULF1 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210043.</obo:IAO_0000115>
