        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L2-4 LINC00507 GLP2R MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of CALCRL (Hsap), MOXD1 (Hsap), PENK (Hsap). These cells also express LINC00507 (Hsap), GLP2R (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210047.</obo:IAO_0000115>
