        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of LINC00343 (Hsap), THEMIS (Hsap), PXDN (Hsap). These cells also express THEMIS (Hsap), C1QL3 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210049.</obo:IAO_0000115>
