        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CARM1P1 (Hsap), CCDC68 (Hsap), PRSS12 (Hsap) expressing glutamatergic neuron of middle temporal gyrus (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
