        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>RMST (Hsap), MME (Hsap) expressing glutamatergic neuron of middle temporal gyrus (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Exc L3-5 RORB COL22A1 middle temporal gyrus glutamatergic neuron (Hsap)</rdfs:label>
