        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of LOC101927281 (Hsap), TWIST2 (Hsap), CCDC168 (Hsap). These cells also express RORB (Hsap), TWIST2 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210054.</obo:IAO_0000115>
