        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L5-6 RORB TTC12 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of LOC105371833 (Hsap), NPFFR2 (Hsap), TNNT2 (Hsap). These cells also express RORB (Hsap), TTC12 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210058.</obo:IAO_0000115>
