        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L4-5 FEZF2 SCN4B MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of LOC105376457 (Hsap), LOC105378657 (Hsap). These cells also express FEZF2 (Hsap), SCN4B (Hsap). These cells have projection type extratelencephalic projecting. The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210060.</obo:IAO_0000115>
