        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L5-6 THEMIS FGF10 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of LOC101928964 (Hsap), GAS2L3 (Hsap). These cells also express THEMIS (Hsap), FGF10 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210063.</obo:IAO_0000115>
