        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L4-6 FEZF2 IL26 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of IFNG-AS1 (Hsap), IL26 (Hsap). These cells also express FEZF2 (Hsap), IL26 (Hsap). These cells have projection type near projecting. The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210064.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>IFNG-AS1 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>IL26 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Exc L4-6 FEZF2 IL26</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>IFNG-AS1 (Hsap), IL26 (Hsap) expressing glutamatergic neuron of middle temporal gyrus (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>L5 NP</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Exc L4-6 FEZF2 IL26 middle temporal gyrus glutamatergic neuron (Hsap)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
