        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of SULF1 (Hsap), ADAMTSL1 (Hsap). These cells also express FEZF2 (Hsap), ABO (Hsap). These cells have projection type corticothalamic projecting. The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210065.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>ADAMTSL1 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <obo:PCL_0010058>SULF1 (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Exc L5-6 FEZF2 ABO</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>L6 CT</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>SULF1 (Hsap), ADAMTSL1 (Hsap) expressing glutamatergic neuron of middle temporal gyrus (Homo sapiens)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>Exc L5-6 FEZF2 ABO middle temporal gyrus glutamatergic neuron (Hsap)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
