        <obo:IAO_0000028>Exc L5-6 FEZF2 IL15 MTG (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens middle temporal gyrus. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the middle temporal gyrus by their selective expression of ERG (Hsap), NPNT (Hsap), NR4A2 (Hsap). These cells also express FEZF2 (Hsap), IL15 (Hsap). The reference data for this cell type is CS1908210067.</obo:IAO_0000115>
