        <rdfs:comment>VLMC is: Vascular leptomeningeal cells. In Human primary motor cortex (CCN201912131), VLMC has 1 child type: VLMC L1-5 PDGFRA COLEC12. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is COL1A2 and COLEC12 (F-beta = 0.929), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. VLMC cells represent 18.87% of all Non-Neural cells collected in the Human M1 10Xv3 dataset. VLMC cells have an average of 1510 genes detected, which is 63 more than the average for all Non-Neural cells (1447).</rdfs:comment>
