        <rdfs:comment>L2/3 IT is: Layer 2/3 intratelencephalic-projecting. In Human primary motor cortex (CCN201912131), L2/3 IT has 8 child types: Exc L2 LAMP5 KCNG3, Exc L2 LINC00507 ATP7B, Exc L2 LINC00507 GLRA3, Exc L2-3 RORB RTKN2, Exc L2-3 LINC00507 DSG3, Exc L3 LAMP5 CARM1P1, Exc L2-3 RORB CCDC68 and Exc L2-3 RORB PTPN3. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is CUX2 and FAM19A1 (F-beta = 0.946), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. L2/3 IT cells represent 50.04% of all Glutamatergic cells collected in the Human M1 10Xv3 dataset. L2/3 IT cells have an average of 5945 genes detected, which is 197 less than the average for all Glutamatergic cells (6142).</rdfs:comment>
