        <rdfs:comment>L6 IT is: Layer 6 intratelencephalic-projecting. In Human primary motor cortex (CCN201912131), L6 IT has 3 child types: Exc L6 THEMIS LINC00343, Exc L6 THEMIS SLN and Exc L6 THEMIS SNTG2. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is LINC00343 and LOC101928278 and THEMIS (F-beta = 0.684), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. L6 IT cells represent 3.78% of all Glutamatergic cells collected in the Human M1 10Xv3 dataset. L6 IT cells have an average of 6366 genes detected, which is 224 more than the average for all Glutamatergic cells (6142).</rdfs:comment>
