        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Inh L1 SST P4HA3</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>In Human primary motor cortex (CCN201912131), Inh L1 SST P4HA3 is a member of the Sncg subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is ARHGAP42 and FOXO1 and ST8SIA6 (F-beta = 0.479), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Inh L1 SST P4HA3 cells represent 4.25% of all Sncg cells collected in the Human M1 10Xv3 dataset. Inh L1 SST P4HA3 cells have an average of 4372 genes detected, which is 118 more than the average for all Sncg cells (4254).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RNAseq 017 - CS201912131_17</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>Inh L1 SST P4HA3</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


