        <obo:PCL_0010059>CS201912131_18</obo:PCL_0010059>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Inh L1 SST DEFB108B</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>In Human primary motor cortex (CCN201912131), Inh L1 SST DEFB108B is a member of the Sncg subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is NDST4 and SYT10 (F-beta = 0.519), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Inh L1 SST DEFB108B cells represent 24.92% of all Sncg cells collected in the Human M1 10Xv3 dataset. Inh L1 SST DEFB108B cells have an average of 3768 genes detected, which is 486 less than the average for all Sncg cells (4254).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RNAseq 018 - CS201912131_18</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>Inh L1 SST DEFB108B</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


