        <rdfs:comment>In Human primary motor cortex (CCN201912131), Inh L3-5 VIP IGDCC3 is a member of the Vip subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is EREG and NOX4 (F-beta = 0.596), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Inh L3-5 VIP IGDCC3 cells represent 8.03% of all Vip cells collected in the Human M1 10Xv3 dataset. Inh L3-5 VIP IGDCC3 cells have an average of 4052 genes detected, which is 196 less than the average for all Vip cells (4248).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RNAseq 028 - CS201912131_28</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>Inh L3-5 VIP IGDCC3</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


