        <rdfs:comment>In Human primary motor cortex (CCN201912131), Inh L1-5 VIP SMOC1 is a member of the Vip subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is ANGPT1 and SMOC1 and VIP (F-beta = 0.569), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Inh L1-5 VIP SMOC1 cells represent 13.13% of all Vip cells collected in the Human M1 10Xv3 dataset. Inh L1-5 VIP SMOC1 cells have an average of 3697 genes detected, which is 551 less than the average for all Vip cells (4248).</rdfs:comment>
