        <rdfs:comment>Oligo is: Oligodendrocytes (often abbreviated Oligo). In Marmoset primary motor cortex (CCN201912132) Oligo has 3 child types: Oligo SLC1A3 LOC103793418,  Oligo OPALIN LOC103790018 and Oligo OPALIN MOBP. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is ST18 (F-beta = 0.925) based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Oligo cells represent 46.77% of all Non-Neuronal cells collected in the marmoset M1 10Xv3 dataset. Oligo cells have an average of 1908 genes detected which is 408 less than the average for all Non-Neuronal cells (2316).</rdfs:comment>
