        <obo:PCL_0010059>CS201912132_11</obo:PCL_0010059>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Inh SNCG CNTN4</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>In Marmoset primary motor cortex (CCN201912132), Inh SNCG CNTN4 is a member of the Sncg subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is ARHGAP18 and PCDH15 and VEGFC (F-beta = 0.745), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Inh SNCG CNTN4 cells represent 5.1% of all Sncg cells collected in the marmoset M1 10Xv3 dataset. Inh SNCG CNTN4 cells have an average of 3426 genes detected, which is 96 more than the average for all Sncg cells (3330).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RNAseq 11 - CS201912132_11</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>Inh SNCG CNTN4</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


