        <obo:PCL_0010059>CS201912132_15</obo:PCL_0010059>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Inh VIP THSD7B</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>In Marmoset primary motor cortex (CCN201912132), Inh VIP THSD7B is a member of the Vip subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is LOC103788553 and THSD7B (F-beta = 0.564), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Inh VIP THSD7B cells represent 3.43% of all Vip cells collected in the marmoset M1 10Xv3 dataset. Inh VIP THSD7B cells have an average of 3306 genes detected, which is 123 more than the average for all Vip cells (3183).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RNAseq 15 - CS201912132_15</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>Inh VIP THSD7B</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


