        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Inh SNCG LOC108587895</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>In Marmoset primary motor cortex (CCN201912132), Inh SNCG LOC108587895 is a member of the Vip subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is ADARB2 and LOC103793609 and SEMA3C (F-beta = 0.619), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Inh SNCG LOC108587895 cells represent 9.87% of all Vip cells collected in the marmoset M1 10Xv3 dataset. Inh SNCG LOC108587895 cells have an average of 3408 genes detected, which is 225 more than the average for all Vip cells (3183).</rdfs:comment>
