        <rdfs:comment>In Mouse primary motor cortex (CCN202002013), VLMC_1 is a member of the VLMC subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is Col4a6 and Gm30624 and Itih5 (F-beta = 0.702), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. VLMC_1 cells represent 7.15% of all VLMC cells collected in the snRNA-seq 10X v3 B dataset. VLMC_1 cells have an average of 2109 genes detected, which is 365 less than the average for all VLMC cells (2474).</rdfs:comment>
