        <rdfs:comment>In Mouse primary motor cortex (CCN202002013), VLMC_6 is a member of the VLMC subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is Dapl1 and Prg4 and Slc26a7 (F-beta = 0.747), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. VLMC_6 cells represent 6.81% of all VLMC cells collected in the snRNA-seq 10X v3 B dataset. VLMC_6 cells have an average of 3396 genes detected, which is 922 more than the average for all VLMC cells (2474).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RNAseq 109 - CS202002013_109</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>VLMC_6</skos:prefLabel>
