        <rdfs:comment>Non-Neuronal is: Non-neuronal cells of neuroectoderm origin (sometimes called glia). The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell class from other cell classes in the primary motor cortex is Qk (F-beta = 0.958), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. Non-Neuronal cells represent 9.75% of all cells collected in the snRNA-seq 10X v3 B dataset. Non-Neuronal cells have an average of 2509 genes detected, which is 1772 less than the average for allcells (4281).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>RNAseq 091-102 - CS202002013_235</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>Non-Neuronal</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


