        <rdfs:comment>In Mouse primary motor cortex (CCN202002013), L6 CT Kit_2 is a member of the L6 CT subclass. The minimal set of markers required to distinguish this cell type from other cell types in the primary motor cortex is Gm26883 and Nr4a2 and Rxfp1 and Tshz2 (F-beta = 0.685), based on the NS Forest method of marker gene selection. L6 CT Kit_2 cells represent 0.04% of all L6 CT cells collected in the snRNA-seq 10X v3 B dataset. L6 CT Kit_2 cells have an average of 4158 genes detected, which is 699 less than the average for all L6 CT cells (4857).</rdfs:comment>
